  "description": "Ferocious and dangerous beings, \"monsters\". People hunt for safety or to get their skins and claws, I would never eat that kind of meat, which I find disgusting based on common sense. Maron is a strange adventurer who ignores common sense and cooks monsters. A mysterious man who lost his friends, his hometown, his family, and everything else to a dragon that attacked his hometown in the past, unleashes his strongest battles and delicious revenge in a dungeon.\n\n(Source: Piccoma, translated)",
